 BSE|               22       Singlet         -ABBA-                      12.3666
 BSE|               23       Singlet         -ABBA-                      12.5418
 BSE|               24       Singlet         -ABBA-                      12.7111
 BSE|               25       Singlet         -ABBA-                      12.8850
 BSE|
 BSE| Single-particle transitions are built up by (de-)excitations,
 BSE| which we denote by
 BSE|
